Changes: native Rust ANS/XZ decoding and tensor layout conversion, integration
with Screenpipe's existing audiopipe MLX implementation. No weights redistributed.

ONNX architecture templates are derived from istupakov's conversion of NVIDIA
Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3, revision 8f23f0c03c8761650bdb5b40aaf3e40d2c15f1ce:
https://huggingface.co/istupakov/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-onnx
All learned initializers are removed. Audiopipe reconstructs every initializer
from the attributed Bark weights (or generates sinusoidal positions in Rust).
The Rust frontend follows the Parakeet processor algorithm documented by
Hugging Face Transformers (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/blob/main/src/transformers/models/parakeet/feature_extraction_parakeet.py
